  "core_text": "儿子，你怎么了？领导让我去后备箱拿茅台里面明明空的，我实话实说，结果被骂了一顿，项目也给别人做了。傻孩子，领导能不知道自己车里没酒吗？人家要的是结果，你看看这个视频学学人家是怎么做的。小李，你把我后备箱里的茅台拿上去，领导的暗示，你能听得懂吗？没有啊，哎被偷你干什么？赵总，茅台都被偷了，你为什么不让我说呀？领导能不知道后备箱有没有酒吗？不不是职场场上理错错，领导的意思是大忌。车里没有酒，总总却让你送上去，说明他只在意结果，你又何必去在意。车里酒的去向和真实性呢满足领导的需求最重要。哦，赵总，您车里的东西呢，我不好乱翻，就自己准备了。四瓶两瓶，留在您车里了，这两瓶拿上来您先用，姑赵总，咱们下次见啊。哎好，哎，刘总，你怎么走了呀？是不是嫌报价不满意啊？哎，恭喜赵总，拿下合同小李，后续你来负责吧。哎，赵总这没有，哎，这赵总这怎么回事啊？这个项目一直是大刘在负责，赵总突然把项目给我了。茶汤回壶是谈判的收尾动作，象征着交易达成。大刘连这个都不懂，赵总怎么敢把项目交给他呀？不能吧，人情世故，可是门大学问，你要学的呀，还多着呢。老婆，赵，总把上次酒钱转过来了，你看哎，你怎么收了呀？赵总转多了，你赶紧给他退回去，你自以为有原则的退还，只会让领导觉得麻烦，还不如大大方方收下呢。那我是不是得说点啥呀，你就说感谢领导，大气，果然跟着领导有甜头吃，就这样就行了。当然不行啊，赵总，请大家喝奶茶了啊，人人都有再掌声殿下了。我什么时候请大家喝奶茶了？奶茶钱，您不是跟着酒钱一块儿转给我了吗？小李周天来家里坐坐，尝尝你嫂子的手艺。哎，嫂子，你可算出来了，我都快憋死了。李恩，你拉我干什么？我也很急呀，憋死了，不知道的还以为洗手间是什么好地方。哎呀，行了，你们做我去做饭，老赵帮我处理一下鱼啊。哦老婆，我怎么看？赵总和嫂子有点不高兴，因为异性厕所十分钟效应，人家。赵总，老婆刚从卫生间出来，你就是再着急，你等十分钟再怎么可能是因为这个你照做就行。嗯，好嫂子，我来帮你身边。赵总，嫂子，那我先走了，那我们也先走小李，留下接待王总的事情，咱们再碰一下，那得叫小张回来呀，不用你来负责就行。好的，赵总，哎，老婆，你这个厕所十分钟效应还真有说法，这都是不成文的社交规矩。你呀多看看这本闲谈高手，假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交，你就每天看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你也会变成一个会说话的人。当我听到这句话的时候，我的眼泪就出来了。他写的是别人夸你优秀，你就回，那是不优秀点，怎么能和你做朋友？你看很有味道，假如不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交，你每天就看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。哇，这真是太棒了。在这本书里边，有一句话我特别欣赏。他说有人嘲讽你眼睛小，高情商回答，万物皆有裂痕，那是光进来的地方。哇，这真是太棒了，每一句都很有意思，随便翻对吧？哇，这句话太棒了。他写的是别人问你一个月工资多少，你就回比以前好多了，现在吃泡面，敢放两根肠了。我读到这段的时候，我觉得这个让我真是欲解心开啊，这本书就像是个社交宝典，把各种社交场景都变成了问题加答案的形式。你说哪家的书架上不应该有一本这个书，就手把手的教我们不同的场景之下应该怎么说？书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你，这是我这几年来讲过的最简单的一本书。我觉得这书适合所有人，让你不管，在任何场合都能够轻松拿捏，所以强烈推荐。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00001",
      "start_ms": 1620,
      "end_ms": 1960,
      "text": "儿子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1960,
      "end_ms": 2600,
      "text": "你怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3440,
      "end_ms": 6800,
      "text": "领导让我去后备箱拿茅台里面明明空的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7200,
      "end_ms": 8160,
      "text": "我实话实说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8580,
      "end_ms": 9900,
      "text": "结果被骂了一顿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10440,
      "end_ms": 12060,
      "text": "项目也给别人做了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00007",
      "start_ms": 12300,
      "end_ms": 13080,
      "text": "傻孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13540,
      "end_ms": 15580,
      "text": "领导能不知道自己车里没酒吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00009",
      "start_ms": 15920,
      "end_ms": 17200,
      "text": "人家要的是结果，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00010",
      "start_ms": 18340,
      "end_ms": 21380,
      "text": "你看看这个视频学学人家是怎么做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00011",
      "start_ms": 21460,
      "end_ms": 21860,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00012",
      "start_ms": 22140,
      "end_ms": 23955,
      "text": "你把我后备箱里的茅台拿上去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00013",
      "start_ms": 29460,
      "end_ms": 30340,
      "text": "领导的暗示，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00014",
      "start_ms": 30380,
      "end_ms": 31440,
      "text": "你能听得懂吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00015",
      "start_ms": 32440,
      "end_ms": 33160,
      "text": "没有啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00016",
      "start_ms": 33740,
      "end_ms": 38400,
      "text": "哎被偷你干什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00017",
      "start_ms": 39320,
      "end_ms": 39740,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00018",
      "start_ms": 39740,
      "end_ms": 40440,
      "text": "茅台都被偷了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00019",
      "start_ms": 40440,
      "end_ms": 41500,
      "text": "你为什么不让我说呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00020",
      "start_ms": 41580,
      "end_ms": 43720,
      "text": "领导能不知道后备箱有没有酒吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00021",
      "start_ms": 43740,
      "end_ms": 46200,
      "text": "不不是职场场上理错错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00022",
      "start_ms": 46220,
      "end_ms": 47560,
      "text": "领导的意思是大忌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00023",
      "start_ms": 48060,
      "end_ms": 49000,
      "text": "车里没有酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00024",
      "start_ms": 49260,
      "end_ms": 50600,
      "text": "总总却让你送上去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00025",
      "start_ms": 50720,
      "end_ms": 51980,
      "text": "说明他只在意结果，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00026",
      "start_ms": 52240,
      "end_ms": 53320,
      "text": "你又何必去在意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00027",
      "start_ms": 53320,
      "end_ms": 56840,
      "text": "车里酒的去向和真实性呢满足领导的需求最重要。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00028",
      "start_ms": 56840,
      "end_ms": 57080,
      "text": "哦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00029",
      "start_ms": 60280,
      "end_ms": 60755,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00030",
      "start_ms": 61290,
      "end_ms": 62130,
      "text": "您车里的东西呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00031",
      "start_ms": 62130,
      "end_ms": 62830,
      "text": "我不好乱翻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00032",
      "start_ms": 62830,
      "end_ms": 63530,
      "text": "就自己准备了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00033",
      "start_ms": 63530,
      "end_ms": 64600,
      "text": "四瓶两瓶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00034",
      "start_ms": 64600,
      "end_ms": 65420,
      "text": "留在您车里了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00035",
      "start_ms": 65420,
      "end_ms": 67035,
      "text": "这两瓶拿上来您先用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00036",
      "start_ms": 71490,
      "end_ms": 75330,
      "text": "姑赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00037",
      "start_ms": 75510,
      "end_ms": 76450,
      "text": "咱们下次见啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00038",
      "start_ms": 76450,
      "end_ms": 76830,
      "text": "哎好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00039",
      "start_ms": 76850,
      "end_ms": 77225,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00040",
      "start_ms": 77900,
      "end_ms": 78280,
      "text": "刘总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00041",
      "start_ms": 78280,
      "end_ms": 79265,
      "text": "你怎么走了呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00042",
      "start_ms": 79890,
      "end_ms": 81655,
      "text": "是不是嫌报价不满意啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00043",
      "start_ms": 85130,
      "end_ms": 85415,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00044",
      "start_ms": 87200,
      "end_ms": 87920,
      "text": "恭喜赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00045",
      "start_ms": 87920,
      "end_ms": 90445,
      "text": "拿下合同小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00046",
      "start_ms": 90840,
      "end_ms": 92055,
      "text": "后续你来负责吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00047",
      "start_ms": 93510,
      "end_ms": 93750,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00048",
      "start_ms": 93930,
      "end_ms": 96300,
      "text": "赵总这没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00049",
      "start_ms": 96450,
      "end_ms": 96690,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00050",
      "start_ms": 96890,
      "end_ms": 98395,
      "text": "这赵总这怎么回事啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00051",
      "start_ms": 98780,
      "end_ms": 100240,
      "text": "这个项目一直是大刘在负责，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00052",
      "start_ms": 100540,
      "end_ms": 101955,
      "text": "赵总突然把项目给我了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00053",
      "start_ms": 102260,
      "end_ms": 104955,
      "text": "茶汤回壶是谈判的收尾动作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00054",
      "start_ms": 105480,
      "end_ms": 106725,
      "text": "象征着交易达成。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00055",
      "start_ms": 107280,
      "end_ms": 108660,
      "text": "大刘连这个都不懂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00056",
      "start_ms": 108960,
      "end_ms": 110715,
      "text": "赵总怎么敢把项目交给他呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00057",
      "start_ms": 111170,
      "end_ms": 111965,
      "text": "不能吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00058",
      "start_ms": 112400,
      "end_ms": 113240,
      "text": "人情世故，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00059",
      "start_ms": 113400,
      "end_ms": 114545,
      "text": "可是门大学问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00060",
      "start_ms": 115050,
      "end_ms": 115970,
      "text": "你要学的呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00061",
      "start_ms": 116130,
      "end_ms": 117035,
      "text": "还多着呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00062",
      "start_ms": 119810,
      "end_ms": 120230,
      "text": "老婆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00063",
      "start_ms": 120450,
      "end_ms": 120690,
      "text": "赵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00064",
      "start_ms": 120710,
      "end_ms": 121910,
      "text": "总把上次酒钱转过来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00065",
      "start_ms": 121910,
      "end_ms": 124210,
      "text": "你看哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00066",
      "start_ms": 124230,
      "end_ms": 125190,
      "text": "你怎么收了呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00067",
      "start_ms": 125250,
      "end_ms": 126030,
      "text": "赵总转多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00068",
      "start_ms": 126030,
      "end_ms": 127150,
      "text": "你赶紧给他退回去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00069",
      "start_ms": 127330,
      "end_ms": 129070,
      "text": "你自以为有原则的退还，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00070",
      "start_ms": 129250,
      "end_ms": 130630,
      "text": "只会让领导觉得麻烦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00071",
      "start_ms": 130830,
      "end_ms": 132410,
      "text": "还不如大大方方收下呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00072",
      "start_ms": 132930,
      "end_ms": 134390,
      "text": "那我是不是得说点啥呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00073",
      "start_ms": 134870,
      "end_ms": 136050,
      "text": "你就说感谢领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00074",
      "start_ms": 136050,
      "end_ms": 136470,
      "text": "大气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00075",
      "start_ms": 136690,
      "end_ms": 138330,
      "text": "果然跟着领导有甜头吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00076",
      "start_ms": 139230,
      "end_ms": 140130,
      "text": "就这样就行了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00077",
      "start_ms": 140270,
      "end_ms": 141415,
      "text": "当然不行啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00078",
      "start_ms": 143720,
      "end_ms": 144120,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00079",
      "start_ms": 144120,
      "end_ms": 145520,
      "text": "请大家喝奶茶了啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00080",
      "start_ms": 145520,
      "end_ms": 148715,
      "text": "人人都有再掌声殿下了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00081",
      "start_ms": 152330,
      "end_ms": 153910,
      "text": "我什么时候请大家喝奶茶了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00082",
      "start_ms": 154430,
      "end_ms": 154970,
      "text": "奶茶钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00083",
      "start_ms": 154970,
      "end_ms": 156770,
      "text": "您不是跟着酒钱一块儿转给我了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00084",
      "start_ms": 157630,
      "end_ms": 159850,
      "text": "小李周天来家里坐坐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00085",
      "start_ms": 160030,
      "end_ms": 161210,
      "text": "尝尝你嫂子的手艺。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00086",
      "start_ms": 165900,
      "end_ms": 166140,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00087",
      "start_ms": 166480,
      "end_ms": 166860,
      "text": "嫂子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00088",
      "start_ms": 166860,
      "end_ms": 167600,
      "text": "你可算出来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00089",
      "start_ms": 167600,
      "end_ms": 168655,
      "text": "我都快憋死了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00090",
      "start_ms": 171840,
      "end_ms": 172240,
      "text": "李恩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00091",
      "start_ms": 172820,
      "end_ms": 173480,
      "text": "你拉我干什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00092",
      "start_ms": 173480,
      "end_ms": 174160,
      "text": "我也很急呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00093",
      "start_ms": 174160,
      "end_ms": 174740,
      "text": "憋死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00094",
      "start_ms": 176960,
      "end_ms": 180520,
      "text": "不知道的还以为洗手间是什么好地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00095",
      "start_ms": 180760,
      "end_ms": 181205,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00096",
      "start_ms": 181590,
      "end_ms": 182030,
      "text": "行了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00097",
      "start_ms": 182230,
      "end_ms": 183170,
      "text": "你们做我去做饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00098",
      "start_ms": 183310,
      "end_ms": 186100,
      "text": "老赵帮我处理一下鱼啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00099",
      "start_ms": 186100,
      "end_ms": 186965,
      "text": "哦老婆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00100",
      "start_ms": 187480,
      "end_ms": 188265,
      "text": "我怎么看？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00101",
      "start_ms": 188900,
      "end_ms": 190380,
      "text": "赵总和嫂子有点不高兴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00102",
      "start_ms": 190720,
      "end_ms": 192705,
      "text": "因为异性厕所十分钟效应，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00103",
      "start_ms": 193040,
      "end_ms": 193320,
      "text": "人家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00104",
      "start_ms": 193320,
      "end_ms": 193620,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00105",
      "start_ms": 193620,
      "end_ms": 195200,
      "text": "老婆刚从卫生间出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00106",
      "start_ms": 195260,
      "end_ms": 196220,
      "text": "你就是再着急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00107",
      "start_ms": 196220,
      "end_ms": 199835,
      "text": "你等十分钟再怎么可能是因为这个你照做就行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00108",
      "start_ms": 200990,
      "end_ms": 201210,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00109",
      "start_ms": 201210,
      "end_ms": 201960,
      "text": "好嫂子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00110",
      "start_ms": 201960,
      "end_ms": 203550,
      "text": "我来帮你身边。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00111",
      "start_ms": 205720,
      "end_ms": 206120,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00112",
      "start_ms": 206180,
      "end_ms": 206640,
      "text": "嫂子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00113",
      "start_ms": 206780,
      "end_ms": 207645,
      "text": "那我先走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00114",
      "start_ms": 209700,
      "end_ms": 211560,
      "text": "那我们也先走小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00115",
      "start_ms": 211560,
      "end_ms": 213100,
      "text": "留下接待王总的事情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00116",
      "start_ms": 213100,
      "end_ms": 213900,
      "text": "咱们再碰一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00117",
      "start_ms": 213980,
      "end_ms": 215195,
      "text": "那得叫小张回来呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00118",
      "start_ms": 215570,
      "end_ms": 217165,
      "text": "不用你来负责就行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00119",
      "start_ms": 217570,
      "end_ms": 217830,
      "text": "好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00120",
      "start_ms": 217830,
      "end_ms": 218165,
      "text": "赵总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00121",
      "start_ms": 218430,
      "end_ms": 218650,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00122",
      "start_ms": 218650,
      "end_ms": 219115,
      "text": "老婆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00123",
      "start_ms": 219520,
      "end_ms": 222015,
      "text": "你这个厕所十分钟效应还真有说法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00124",
      "start_ms": 222540,
      "end_ms": 224415,
      "text": "这都是不成文的社交规矩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00125",
      "start_ms": 224830,
      "end_ms": 227050,
      "text": "你呀多看看这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00126",
      "start_ms": 227230,
      "end_ms": 228290,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00127",
      "start_ms": 228330,
      "end_ms": 229010,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00128",
      "start_ms": 229030,
      "end_ms": 229770,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00129",
      "start_ms": 229850,
      "end_ms": 230850,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00130",
      "start_ms": 230990,
      "end_ms": 232090,
      "text": "你就每天看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00131",
      "start_ms": 232170,
      "end_ms": 233405,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00132",
      "start_ms": 233620,
      "end_ms": 235260,
      "text": "你也会变成一个会说话的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00133",
      "start_ms": 235260,
      "end_ms": 236440,
      "text": "当我听到这句话的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00134",
      "start_ms": 236440,
      "end_ms": 237615,
      "text": "我的眼泪就出来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00135",
      "start_ms": 237840,
      "end_ms": 239180,
      "text": "他写的是别人夸你优秀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00136",
      "start_ms": 239180,
      "end_ms": 239660,
      "text": "你就回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00137",
      "start_ms": 239760,
      "end_ms": 240780,
      "text": "那是不优秀点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00138",
      "start_ms": 240920,
      "end_ms": 242080,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00139",
      "start_ms": 242240,
      "end_ms": 243185,
      "text": "你看很有味道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00140",
      "start_ms": 243420,
      "end_ms": 244320,
      "text": "假如不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00141",
      "start_ms": 244400,
      "end_ms": 245080,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00142",
      "start_ms": 245080,
      "end_ms": 245860,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00143",
      "start_ms": 245980,
      "end_ms": 246980,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00144",
      "start_ms": 247160,
      "end_ms": 248275,
      "text": "你每天就看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00145",
      "start_ms": 248520,
      "end_ms": 249820,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00146",
      "start_ms": 249940,
      "end_ms": 252320,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00147",
      "start_ms": 252360,
      "end_ms": 252580,
      "text": "哇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00148",
      "start_ms": 252580,
      "end_ms": 253565,
      "text": "这真是太棒了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00149",
      "start_ms": 253860,
      "end_ms": 254620,
      "text": "在这本书里边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00150",
      "start_ms": 254620,
      "end_ms": 255835,
      "text": "有一句话我特别欣赏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00151",
      "start_ms": 256160,
      "end_ms": 257580,
      "text": "他说有人嘲讽你眼睛小，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00152",
      "start_ms": 257580,
      "end_ms": 258480,
      "text": "高情商回答，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00153",
      "start_ms": 258500,
      "end_ms": 259540,
      "text": "万物皆有裂痕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00154",
      "start_ms": 259620,
      "end_ms": 261040,
      "text": "那是光进来的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00155",
      "start_ms": 261260,
      "end_ms": 261440,
      "text": "哇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00156",
      "start_ms": 261440,
      "end_ms": 262400,
      "text": "这真是太棒了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00157",
      "start_ms": 262420,
      "end_ms": 263540,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00158",
      "start_ms": 263540,
      "end_ms": 264480,
      "text": "随便翻对吧？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00159",
      "start_ms": 264480,
      "end_ms": 264660,
      "text": "哇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00160",
      "start_ms": 264660,
      "end_ms": 265705,
      "text": "这句话太棒了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00161",
      "start_ms": 266050,
      "end_ms": 267810,
      "text": "他写的是别人问你一个月工资多少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00162",
      "start_ms": 267810,
      "end_ms": 269345,
      "text": "你就回比以前好多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00163",
      "start_ms": 269720,
      "end_ms": 270440,
      "text": "现在吃泡面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00164",
      "start_ms": 270440,
      "end_ms": 271540,
      "text": "敢放两根肠了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00165",
      "start_ms": 271540,
      "end_ms": 272540,
      "text": "我读到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00166",
      "start_ms": 272540,
      "end_ms": 274525,
      "text": "我觉得这个让我真是欲解心开啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00167",
      "start_ms": 274740,
      "end_ms": 276335,
      "text": "这本书就像是个社交宝典，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00168",
      "start_ms": 276610,
      "end_ms": 279510,
      "text": "把各种社交场景都变成了问题加答案的形式。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00169",
      "start_ms": 279630,
      "end_ms": 282075,
      "text": "你说哪家的书架上不应该有一本这个书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00170",
      "start_ms": 282310,
      "end_ms": 285250,
      "text": "就手把手的教我们不同的场景之下应该怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00171",
      "start_ms": 285570,
      "end_ms": 288235,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00172",
      "start_ms": 288420,
      "end_ms": 289600,
      "text": "你就放心拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00173",
      "start_ms": 289600,
      "end_ms": 290960,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00174",
      "start_ms": 291160,
      "end_ms": 293675,
      "text": "这是我这几年来讲过的最简单的一本书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00175",
      "start_ms": 294020,
      "end_ms": 295405,
      "text": "我觉得这书适合所有人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00176",
      "start_ms": 295660,
      "end_ms": 296160,
      "text": "让你不管，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00177",
      "start_ms": 296160,
      "end_ms": 298275,
      "text": "在任何场合都能够轻松拿捏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ca658fdf2e49e804_s00178",
      "start_ms": 298580,
      "end_ms": 299575,
      "text": "所以强烈推荐。"
    }
  ],
